1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:04,800
Approved expenses… and not one receipt. Hospitality, travel, commissions.

2
00:00:05,300 --> 00:00:11,800
Why they slip: each claim is small, spread across people and accounts, and the annual sample rarely picks them.

3
00:00:12,200 --> 00:00:24,000
SEG checks every approved claim for an attachment. Thirty-one of forty-two with no document. A medium finding; the evidence is the claims themselves in Odoo. Illustrative test data.

4
00:00:24,300 --> 00:00:28,800
The control: an attachment before approval, and a clear cap for claims without a receipt.

5
00:00:29,300 --> 00:00:34,000
Standard Enterprise Governance, the platform that audits itself. seg-audit.com.
